  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760182,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1942 (Game Boy Color) - Synopsis\n\nRelive the classic arcade action in this faithful Game Boy Color port of Capcom's iconic 1984 shooter, *1942*. Set in the Pacific Theater of World War II, players take on the role of an American P-38 fighter pilot, tasked with battling against the Japanese air fleet and ultimately reaching Tokyo. Loosely based on the pivotal Battle of Midway, the game captures the intensity and challenge of the original.\n\nExperience vertical scrolling gameplay as you navigate through enemy formations, dodging bullets and collecting power-ups to enhance your firepower. The signature \"roll\" feature, allowing for brief invincibility and a change in direction, returns to help you survive the onslaught. \n\nThis handheld version brings the adrenaline-pumping action of the arcade to the Game Boy Color, offering a nostalgic trip for veterans and a thrilling introduction for new players. While a smaller screen, the core gameplay remains intact, delivering a classic scrolling shooter experience on the go. It's a piece of Capcom history, now available in vibrant, handheld format."
    },
